        A D&D (Dungeons & Dragons) style fantasy role playing
        VR.  Interestingly, like traditional D&D (gads, am I old
        enough to call it "traditional"?  ;-), player characters
        persist: you can play the same character by bringing a
        magnetically coded key to the video arcade the next time
        you play, rather than a paper character sheet.

